title: Device-code kit endpoints
severity: medium
score: 30
tags: consent-phishing
attack: T1528
description: A non-Microsoft, non-allowlisted host serves two of the EvilTokens device-flow
  endpoints (/api/device/gate, /start, /status/<session>) or receives the X-Antibot-
  Token header. Seen alone when the kit's gate shows its decoy instead of the code; with
  a code or a hand-off it is eviltokens_device_code_kit.
---
